ons cannot change.\nPlans persist. repeat counts complete executions, not rounds. Continuing work retains its exact operation, paid progress and reserved material; follow its cancellation contract. A global pause preserves costs. Normal satiety decline and successful outgoing messages do not stop plans. Urgent relevant messages, real failures, completed learning or new danger can cause a decision. Movement uses known geometry and real distance; an occupied coordinate is not a reachable meeting point. No effect happens merely because a plan describes it.\nReturn queries with result_json null, or queries=[] with result_json containing the JSON plan. A plan has intention:string, steps:[{action:{interface:string,args:object},repeat:positive integer,until:condition|null,guard:condition|null}], repeat:positive integer, until:condition|null, interrupts:string[], notes:string[], preferences:string[], projects:project[]. At most six steps, four projects and concise notes. A condition is {path,comparison,value}; comparison lt/lte/gt/gte/eq/neq; paths self.health/satiety/energy/temperature/happiness/inventory.RESOURCE or tick. Use interrupts=[] unless a supplied event is needed. A project has id,status(active/paused/completed/abandoned),question,evidence:string[],uncertainty,goal,completedSteps:string[],outputs:string[],missing,next,pauseReason,benefit. All other project fields are strings. Omitted projects persist. Give factual evidence and observed benefits, never claimed physical changes. Partial plans and protected-state edits are rejected.\nBatch up to four control queries. Each has section, search, ids:string[], offset>=0 and part>=0. Sections abilities/inventory/knowledge/projects/memory/state/observed; world may query only abilities. Exact IDs or text search; use empty search and ids for pagination. No implicit access outside this scope. Remaining query batches are explicit; when zero return a decision. Every model response, including retrieval and failure, consumes the shared budget.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_051553ad312d30f8016b04882de22487d1929a62312a27f535","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABrBIgukwSSRUycbO8Oe4_TVVv4CVx4nkSy74Jw6vt2BqtNbCnPN_TrGAKJ4AxR4yb-QXMFrOscLOH5LIqxDxtd_NW0XOY9L30m1RlmpwqSv0jCGH9uxeDr0Dui9w-zAlHxz35B9V43RtdRbTbRs-HpBx6l1xBbSaOqmETNTK9SEa4ufWalNXF9gI0YoxhuHgdWlB9sx4FXmJRH2aZNsRCmimAjwyuLV2jtCCb8NYLznYEH3zp87ObyD-Z6PDwiSVaU0zr7opjygMb_-vcth3b3P2mIpn0WXG1Y_RzFTOU69fo5IzAlCHNiln-baWTbg8GRETjS6eCX-600X_8hByDbAp2LqeC7Hx96Juhx61gdlEU1HZL-e_NjPYyqQgjS5y437z1vNCdDNa6sbzHEwFrYSX-DVCO9HYTUZtCivT7EqTRisI5T7P32GYIO36GhAupJMsEMSRPSXTnWmjaWAQFlGuNiGpekaRh3PxPqNTKgNXTocrVVWNEHXhd3pzsFU8IhSyUk_HC6-7Z7mO2S-gdNe0hGJBIlknKRSBaMVzIaeE5Efq5J_NH-APjox9CNhxFxHSbttqFpLRWX5xTU7zndZCx4XpgIk1kZEPrgr7jp_BhYGWYmZlmDeGoVpLGzeTfn5Q6jzcR3hhj7giZ8iahx-RliIRfIPdlJz5pXhfrnE9ej9qqXmk5qLgAkNxOus2FvKRQFNyOzMDdNMWJKuviMZeRJMCi1jd88DMKsDILLfN9YokQnglcEIbdoqvuq2SMv4ASmon6OFnGlVDtZsx9-hFYO2PgcHmrhSXnQ2n5u9MBeOejijwWC1JBVFFiVHlm7xA5ae6FePLVmUqCZwzpVlnNKweRZGMLOJ0EzMlW_karZXEOxcBLXqbZj7AGeBIiUggFO4B44h_UopTqHiRJBkEydLt7fYHJ7M3Q0-E1YpGNfCUGI8bFzpOyqgsLbv7QMc8woM09VqpZGDgIeP2GPBpzBuCf2-Upy2EDGIHT4vQkHU4TACtdBYfY0rFxC_PNbC6Ro9ArEI-qbh2LkZtusnz0aIP71TNCkqcam5sBUUlJKsxOub5QFbvfQMWz-zjmWU47Gphjt1sPZZC77LN4pgg7cjQl9L__FNEz8We-PGYLgGFwNEUIp68tlUA9K6SX2Cosvo16TswsypUtxibw33KBsu4_bBdREvHylpkZBuksQuTLvU_XprDnRMzi17VAfmMp4HhSUyYP1nYCyvarFndcPNkVe_Luc0vzhhgrqRVwiV31SWAZlv4FCRgpgzAfNN4cLKjd62ud3U1_zHzAKDs9qLhNgxE8JhYhZvzghylgUBWlEKRUg3QJu6a9AWQin6IMS619aKc-jvj0aQ_YEY0xfOnKGGiDHN1P09xeAZ051ZsVngsCGjND-ElEMQzDKmSLh2ZF8vMYegBPpJEZtbwdEQHZBZmggSFISyKMMgvy9cS_MMzLe1ytJmTgGRv-8PGUf7ZamY_LefXWTXNrstTK2qU4-0xy1NTbZz9cO2EGxcxyrEKONXLuWFXOv56zNjCBabYVf9-gRVbVM9LccGvkREnQdbpPf-SS2l9IGJX3zm8YRF7cLaIeDt_TjooR5QTphljyEXesLoL0H41NN7DVRScN6DWMpnhlspW7gSBDKWX_aSQqx_6WpY_j2GfChQZVS_RAyuR28ttd9gzaHWjGLVMWKSMHRzAlgZg1U-2Tb4g22K3_28Bpq50LTdwld5Aemq6pCv8jAJossbOaukNO1SQqyQ7x7VfBad0VWqsUkSmtdPjhOQ1ZDe-aKmw6cl7mHpwaPJuWEekKHhQhIhllCu0prvpQW6PBplaBn2hES