rgy 27.37. I am continuing toward forest-apple-2 at (6.2,18.3), whose last known stock was 14 at tick 146. Current stock is unconfirmed. Known berry sources were depleted. I have no established personal apple food-safety finding. Apply only if I successfully collect an actual apple.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":\\\"One actual owned apple collected from forest-apple-2 and existing personal evidence. Any additional necessary tools or materials are unknown.\\\",\\\"costs\\\":\\\"Method, learning time, energy and specimen costs are unknown; disclose them. This request authorizes no ingestion or specimen consumption.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Enable an evidence-bounded food-use decision and record only findings from actual assessment or separately chosen trials. Do not infer safety from appearance or create nutrition, food stock or benefits through the request.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.inventory.apple\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":1}}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"Retain the exact ongoing navigation operation and its paid progress.\\\",\\\"The nearby apple seedling has zero stock; it is not the remembered mature source.\\\",\\\"The observed deer are fleeing; no pursuit or contact is planned.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[],\\\"projects\\\":[]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"c33799b3-5ba1-4e91-a2df-84894d5b5dac","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["section","search","ids","offset","part"],"properties":{"section":{"type":"string","enum":["